Rozex Plus — «حبوبك ترجع كل شهر؟» (20 s, 1080×1920, Instagram Reel)
Style: Tablet Sketch Explainer, from the Lemo-Opuscar library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar). Made for Dermavia.

No AI-generated images, no stock footage, no pasted photos: paper, pencil lines, colour blocks, the stylus, the skin
section and the tube are drawn by the code in this folder. The tube was drawn using the client's own product photo
(ref/rozex-plus-pack.png, Dermavia) as a drawing reference only; the photo does not appear in the film.

FONTS (SIL Open Font License 1.1; licence texts in fonts/)
- Aref Ruqaa (Regular, Bold) — The Aref Ruqaa Project Authors — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/arefruqaa
  Arabic lettering on the page; each line shaped with HarfBuzz (uharfbuzz, Apache-2.0) right to left before its
  stroke skeleton was built (tools/glyphs.py).
- Caveat Bold — The Caveat Project Authors — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/caveat
  (static 700 instance cut from the variable font with fontTools) — ingredient names, title, SPF line, phone number.

MUSIC SAMPLES (played by the library's core/audio/sampler.py)
- guitar_nylon (classical guitar), world_perc (egg shaker), kalimba: FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), CC0 1.0
- jazz_bass (Sneakybass double bass): Karoryfer Samples / sfzinstruments, CC0 1.0
Original score (mix.py). Pencil, colouring, eraser, sheet-slide and chip sounds are synthesised by mix.py with the
library's core/audio/sfx.py.

NO VOICE, NO SUBTITLES (per the brief). All on-screen words are exactly those in TREATMENT.md §4.

CONTENT
- Product name, actives and "Azelaic Acid 20%" as printed on the pack; usage, sunscreen reminder and order line as
  supplied in the brief. No other claims are made.
